  "description": "<p>A complete, ready-to-run Foundry VTT Adventure pack for <strong>Curse of Strahd</strong>, following <a href=\"https://www.strahdreloaded.com/Introduction/A+DM's+Guide+to+Curse+of+Strahd\">DragnaCarta's <em>Curse of Strahd: Reloaded</em></a> and updated for the 2024 D&amp;D rules.</p><p>Includes every pre-built map with walls, lighting, ambient sound and Monk's Active Tile triggers already configured, plus all Actors and Items used by the adventure.</p><p>You will need your own copy of the original <em>Curse of Strahd</em> from WotC or D&amp;D Beyond, and the free <em>Curse of Strahd: Reloaded</em> guide.</p>",
